<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>منيو مطبخ لقمة هنية</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f0f11;
            --card-bg: #1a1a20;
            --accent-gold: #f39c12;
            --accent-green: #2ecc71;
            --text-color: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #b0b0b0;
            --border-color: #2a2a35;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            padding: 20px 15px 90px 15px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e26 0%, #14141a 100%);
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(243, 156, 18, 0.15);
        }

        .header h1 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 20px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background: #22222d;
            border-right: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 25px 0 15px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .menu-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .item-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
        }

        .item-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .item-name {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .item-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .item-price {
            color: var(--accent-green);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.1);
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .fixed-call-btn {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 15px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: calc(100% - 30px);
            max-width: 570px;
            background: #25d366;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>مطبخ لقمة هنية</h1>
        <p>🍲 اكل بيتي - طعم البيت المصري الأصيل</p>
    </div>

    <!-- البيتزا -->
